<div class="page-section"><section class="section padd-top-md padd-bottom-md"><article class="section-layout-wrapper grid-container"><div class="grid-x align-center marg-bottom-md"><div class="cell large-10 text-center"><span class="section-pretitle block-span">Poursuivre la découverte</span><h2 class="section-title">Explorer chaque lieu du littoral</h2></div></div><div class="grid-x grid-margin-x grid-margin-y small-up-1 medium-up-2 large-up-4 align-stretch"><div class="cell"><a href="/explorez/le-littoral-et-les-lacs/ganvie" class="card overlayedCard isRel tpl_05 ratio_4_3" style="display:block;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:.25rem;height:100%;min-height:14rem"><img src="/assets/img/ganvie-640x480.webp" alt="Ganvié" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" /><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(0,0,0,.75) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.15) 55%,transparent 100%)"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:#fff"><h3 style="margin:0 0 .3rem 0;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600">Ganvié</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:.82rem;opacity:.9;line-height:1.4">Le village lacustre sur pilotis, la « Venise de l'Afrique », habité depuis trois siècles.</p></div></a></div><div class="cell"><a href="/explorez/le-littoral-et-les-lacs/grand-popo" class="card overlayedCard isRel tpl_05 ratio_4_3" style="display:block;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:.25rem;height:100%;min-height:14rem"><img src="/assets/img/plage-grand-popo-640x480.webp" alt="Grand-Popo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" /><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(0,0,0,.75) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.15) 55%,transparent 100%)"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:#fff"><h3 style="margin:0 0 .3rem 0;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600">Grand-Popo</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:.82rem;opacity:.9;line-height:1.4">125 km à l'ouest de Cotonou, plages océaniques, kite-surf et village de pêcheurs.</p></div></a></div><div class="cell"><a href="/explorez/le-littoral-et-les-lacs/le-lac-nokoue" class="card overlayedCard isRel tpl_05 ratio_4_3" style="display:block;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:.25rem;height:100%;min-height:14rem"><img src="/assets/img/littoral-lac-nokoue-640x480.webp?v=2026-11-06" alt="Le lac Nokoué" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" /><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(0,0,0,.75) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.15) 55%,transparent 100%)"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:#fff"><h3 style="margin:0 0 .3rem 0;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600">Le lac Nokoué</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:.82rem;opacity:.9;line-height:1.4">Le plus grand lac du Bénin, pirogues, pêche au acadja et villages sur pilotis.</p></div></a></div><div class="cell"><a href="/explorez/le-littoral-et-les-lacs/peche-et-pirogue" class="card overlayedCard isRel tpl_05 ratio_4_3" style="display:block;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:.25rem;height:100%;min-height:14rem"><img src="/assets/img/pirogue-640x480.webp" alt="Pêche et pirogue" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" /><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(0,0,0,.75) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.15) 55%,transparent 100%)"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:#fff"><h3 style="margin:0 0 .3rem 0;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600">Pêche et pirogue</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:.82rem;opacity:.9;line-height:1.4">Sorties en pirogue à voile ou motorisée, apprentissage de la pêche traditionnelle.</p></div></a></div></div></article></section></div>
